<section class="page-hero compact"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">HEADQUARTERS · PILOT ASSESSMENT</div><h1>Test forms &amp; answer keys</h1><p>Headquarters-only answer keys and immutable session assignments.</p></div></section>
<section class="container section content-wide"><%- include('partials-nav') %>
<div class="alert alert-warning">PILOT ONLY. These answer keys and the raw-score conversion have not been validated against CEFR. Use a newly created pilot session; assignments cannot be changed or made after any result is recorded for that session.</div>
<div class="panel mt"><h2>New pilot test form</h2><p>Keep the answer key confidential. Exactly 40 Reading responses and 35 Listening responses, separated by commas or new lines. No blank keys.</p>
<form class="form-stack" method="post" action="/admin/pilot/forms"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="code">Internal form code</label><input id="code" name="code" required pattern="[A-Z0-9][A-Z0-9_-]{2,39}" maxlength="40" placeholder="PILOT-001"></div><div class="field"><label for="title">Form title</label><input id="title" name="title" required minlength="4" maxlength="120" placeholder="GEST Pilot Test 001"></div></div><div class="field"><label for="rkey">Reading answer key (40)</label><textarea name="reading_key" id="rkey" rows="4" required maxlength="2800" spellcheck="false"></textarea></div><div class="field"><label for="lkey">Listening answer key (35)</label><textarea name="listening_key" id="lkey" rows="4" required maxlength="2450" spellcheck="false"></textarea></div><button class="btn btn-primary">Create immutable form</button></form></div>
<div class="panel mt"><h2>Assign a form to a session</h2><form method="post" action="/admin/pilot/assign" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="session">Unassigned test session</label><select name="session_id" id="session" required><option value="">Select a session</option><% sessions.forEach(s=>{ %><option value="<%= s.id %>"><%= s.code %> · <%= s.test_date %> <%= s.start_time %> · #<%= s.id %></option><% }) %></select></div><div class="field"><label for="form">Test form</label><select name="form_id" id="form" required><option value="">Select a form</option><% forms.forEach(f=>{ %><option value="<%= f.id %>"><%= f.code %> — <%= f.title %></option><% }) %></select></div></div><button class="btn btn-primary" data-submit-confirm="Assign this immutable test form to the session? Existing assignments cannot be changed.">Assign pilot form</button></form></div>
<div class="panel mt"><h2>Existing forms</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Title</th><th>Created</th><th>Fingerprint</th></tr></thead><tbody><% forms.forEach(f=>{ %><tr><td><strong><%= f.code %></strong></td><td><%= f.title %></td><td><%= f.created_at %></td><td><code><%= f.fingerprint.slice(0,16) %>…</code></td></tr><% }) %><% if(!forms.length){ %><tr><td colspan="4">Create a form to begin.</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="panel mt"><h2>Sessions using pilot scoring</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Centre</th><th>Test session</th><th>Form</th></tr></thead><tbody><% assigned.forEach(s=>{ %><tr><td><%= s.code %></td><td><%= s.test_date %> · #<%= s.session_id %></td><td><%= s.form_code %></td></tr><% }) %><% if(!assigned.length){ %><tr><td colspan="3">No pilot sessions assigned yet.</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div></div></section>
